      "description": "Aggregated p95 latency of the API, from the OTel agent's http_server_request_duration_seconds.\n\nONLY THE API HAS THIS. worker, web and admin do not have a metrics SDK — their p95 does not exist anywhere in this stack.\n\nIf it shows \"No data\" while the rest of the dashboard is alive, the near-certain cause is that the API image still carries Application Insights' -javaagent: that agent exports to the connection string's Breeze endpoint and IGNORES OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT. Changing the compose env does not fix it; the JAR in services/api/Dockerfile needs to be swapped and the image republished.",
      "fieldConfig": {
